# Environment variables

Copy to `.env` and edit. Every variable is optional — the defaults in
`src/rag_literature/config.py` already work on a clean machine (everything under `$HOME`).
Export them however you like (shell, `.env` loader, systemd unit, container env).

## Data layout

```bash
RAG_DATA_ROOT=/home/you/rag-data        # one root: .input/ DonePDF/ .RAG_Json/ .vector_db/ ...
RAG_MODELS_DIR=/home/you/rag-models     # local weights: bge-m3, bge-reranker, MinerU cache
RAG_MODELSCOPE_CACHE=/home/you/rag-models/modelscope   # keep this inside MODELS_DIR
```

## MinerU (PDF parsing)

```bash
RAG_MINERU_CONDA_ENV=mineru     # conda env containing the `mineru` CLI
RAG_MINERU_CMD=mineru
RAG_MINERU_METHOD=txt           # txt | ocr
RAG_MINERU_LANG=ch              # ch handles Chinese + English
RAG_MINERU_TIMEOUT=1200         # seconds per PDF; raise for books
RAG_MINERU_MODEL_SOURCE=modelscope   # modelscope | local | huggingface
RAG_MODELSCOPE_CACHE=...        # see above; injected into MinerU by the pipeline
```

## Embedding + vector store

```bash
RAG_EMBEDDING_MODEL=/home/you/rag-models/bge-m3
RAG_CHROMA_DIR=/home/you/rag-data/.vector_db/chroma_data
RAG_CHROMA_COLLECTION=literature_sentences
RAG_RETRIEVAL_INDEX_DIR=/home/you/rag-data/.retrieval_index   # alias: RAG_INDEX_DIR
```

## Retrieval service

```bash
RAG_RERANK=0        # cross-encoder rerank; measured to HURT paper-level recall - leave off
```

## Optional: translation / notes via llama.cpp

```bash
RAG_LLAMA_SERVER_BIN=/home/you/llama_standalone/llama-server
RAG_MODEL_TRANSLATE_7B=/home/you/rag-models/HY-MT1.5-7B-Q4_K_M.gguf
RAG_SERVER_HOST=127.0.0.1
RAG_SERVER_PORT=8081
RAG_IDLE_SLEEP_SECONDS=600
```

## Optional: metadata enrichment

```bash
RAG_S2_KEY=                  # Semantic Scholar key (empty = anonymous, lower rate limit)
RAG_JCR=0                    # 1 = look up JCR quartiles (needs your own EasyScholar key)
RAG_EASYSCHOLAR_KEY=         # no key ships with this repo - register your own
```

## Pipeline behaviour

```bash
RAG_PIPELINE_WORKERS=2       # concurrent papers; GPU memory is the limit, not CPU
RAG_KEEP_IMAGES=0            # 1 = move MinerU-extracted images into images/ and keep them
RAG_MAX_RETRIES=2
```
